        "created_at": "2015-05-13T19:46:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>PennLite, Sadly no. My kids don't appreciate the half-day drive. My next event is is Crown Tourney in Pentamere May 22.</p><p>There was lots of Munchkin in our camp last year. Not my favorite game, but a lot of people like it. I'll bring SotM (sleeved), Go, and probably a couple from the \"Tiny Epic\" line. I'll also have stuff appropriate for the younger kid - Snap Dragon or Orchard.</p>",
